# Frontend Production Environment Variables (Vercel / Netlify)

# 1. Backend API & WebSocket Endpoint
# Replace with your deployed backend URL (Render, Railway, Fly.io, etc.)
# Example: https://cityeye-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=https://cityeye-api.onrender.com

# WebSocket URL is auto-derived from VITE_API_URL (https -> wss).
# If custom, specify here:
# VITE_WS_URL=wss://cityeye-api.onrender.com/ws

# 2. Map Tiles & Basemap (Optional)
# If left unset, CityEye automatically uses the watermark-free Esri Dark Canvas (100% free, no key needed)
# If you have a CARTO API Key, paste it here:
# VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=your_carto_master_api_key
# Or use custom Mapbox/Stadia tile URL:
# VITE_MAP_TILE_URL=https://api.mapbox.com/styles/v1/mapbox/dark-v11/tiles/{z}/{x}/{y}?access_token=your_token
